# Student app

Read `AGENTS.md` in the repo root before implementing features or Firebase changes.

Hard constraints:

- Single institution: `institutions/default` (`kDefaultInstitutionId`)
- White-label brand pack in `assets/branding/` (swap via `dart run tool/apply_brand.dart <id>`)
- Roles: `admin`, `teacher`, `viewer` (viewer = parent and student)
- Two editions, **one app**: default Spark; production via `--dart-define=APP_EDITION=production` plus Blaze deploy of Functions/Storage — see `AGENTS.md` and `lib/core/app_config.dart`
- Core workflows must run on Spark without Functions or Storage
- Roles come from Firestore `users/{uid}`, not Auth custom claims, unless Functions are on Blaze
- Firebase project ID: `student-mgmt-sdd2011-bddf7`
- Flutter: Homebrew at `/opt/homebrew/bin/flutter` — do not clone a second SDK into `$HOME/flutter`
- Do not put secrets in source or chat

Stack: Flutter + Riverpod + go_router + Firebase Auth/Firestore. Screens live in `lib/features/`, data in `lib/data/`.
